# =============================================================================
#  SUPERMAN - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Man of Steel")          Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "Superman_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "Superman_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s - noble, open, optimistic strength
#    0-60     : the hero stance - wide planted feet, fists on hips, elbows wide, chest broad, chin up; slow deep breath
#               every 90 f; gaze sweeps the horizon (left, then centre)
#    60-130   : "sky call" - he rises on his toes, chest lifts, elbows flare, gaze goes to the sky
#    130-186  : the coil - knees bend, arms pull back, chest folds forward
#    150-240  : FLIGHT LAUNCH - the right fist rockets overhead, the left arm streams back, he leans into the flight line
#               and lifts ~0.4 stud off the ground; feet come together with pointed toes; alive in the hold
#    240-300  : he settles - fist lowers back to the hip, feet come apart, a soft landing with knee absorption
#    300-360  : back in the hero stance, a confident glance to the side, then back to centre
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.  The lift-off height is animated on TORSO only.
# =============================================================================
